  "source_code": "# cook your dish here\r\nm = 200004\r\nM = 998244353\r\nans =[0] * (m)\r\nfor i in range(1, m): ans[i] = pow(i, M-2, M)\r\n\r\nHn = [0] * m \r\nfor i in range(1, m):\r\n    Hn[i] = (Hn[i-1] + ans[i])%M \r\n\r\nt = int(input())\r\n\r\ndef solver(n, a):\r\n    ans = 0 \r\n    for i in range(n):\r\n        ans += ((Hn[i] + Hn[n-1-i]) * a[i])%M\r\n        ans %= M \r\n    return ans\r\n    \r\nfor i in range(t):\r\n    n = int(input())\r\n    a = list(map(int, input().split()))\r\n    print(solver(n, a))\r\n",
